      "comment": "PIGEON'S DESIRE (8) goes very well this course and distance starting 95 times for 32 wins and 40 minors. In the money last time at this track (19.21) in a Free For All, finishing a 11 length third. Looks suited and should go close. SLIPPERY BOGAN (2) jumped favourite and was too quick with an all-the-way win last start (18.67) at Dubbo in a Grade 5 over 318m. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Can make it two on the bounce. KOSTECKI (1) is worth forgiving last start after finishing fifth (19.44) at this track over 330m. Cannot be underestimated. TOMMY'S AVA (4) can fill a top-three spot.",
